%% frame: UC6 B2 to B4: refund obligations inside the expiry transaction (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Exp as proxy : GroupDealExpiryService
    participant Pub as :ApplicationEventPublisher
    participant Sub as :TeamExpiryRefundSubscriber
    participant Svc as :TeamExpiryRefundService
    participant Adp as :OrderFulfilmentAdapter
    participant Set as :GroupDealSettlementSupportImpl
    participant Deals as :PaidGroupDealRepository
    participant Deal as :GroupDeal
    participant Repo as :CheckoutPaymentRepositoryImpl
    participant Map as :PaymentMapper

    critical expiry transaction, REQUIRED, READ COMMITTED, 10 s
        Note over Exp,Svc: B1: inside expireOne(dealId), after lock 1 and the guarded expire (@sec-a-uc05)
        Exp->>Pub: publishEvent(TeamExpired)
        Pub-->>Exp: held until commit
        Note over Exp,Adp: BEFORE_COMMIT, on the committing thread, the transaction owner calls each listener: @Order(10) has cancelled the orders (UC5)
        Exp->>Sub: onTeamExpired(event), @Order(20)
        Sub->>Svc: recordExpiredTeam(dealId)
        Note over Svc,Deals: TransactionTemplate joins the expiry transaction (REQUIRED)
        Note over Svc,Deals: B2: the team must still exist and be EXPIRED
        Svc->>Adp: lockExpiredTeam(dealId)
        Adp->>Set: lockExpiredTeam(dealId)
        Set->>Deals: lockDeal(dealId): lock 1, the team row (already held)
        Deals-->>Set: Optional(GroupDeal)
        Set->>Deal: status()
        Deal-->>Set: DealStatus
        break team missing or status is not EXPIRED (E1)
            Set-->>Svc: IllegalStateException, the expiry rolls back
        end
        Note over Svc,Map: B3 and B4: eventId = "team-expired-" + dealId
        Svc->>Repo: requireRefundsForExpiredTeam(dealId, "TEAM_EXPIRED", eventId)
        Repo->>Map: lockRefundableMemberIds(dealId): lock 3, payments by id
        Map-->>Repo: List(UUID) locked
        Repo->>Map: refundExpiredTeam(dealId, reason, eventId)
        Map-->>Repo: int written
        break written differs from locked (E1)
            Repo-->>Svc: IllegalStateException, the expiry rolls back
        end
    end
    Note over Exp,Map: COMMIT: team EXPIRED, orders CANCELLED, one pending biz_refund row per succeeded payment
